<title>CHINA: Shanghai Friendship H1 audited net up 77 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Friendship H1 audited net up 77 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in million of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover		 284.95    vs    269.17</p>
<p> Net profit		27.92    vs     15.759</p>
<p> Earnings per share     0.25 yuan     vs     0.15 yuan</p>
<p> Net assets per share   3.00 yuan     vs     3.37 yuan</p>
<p>Note: the figures were audited. Shanghai Friendship &amp; Overseas Chinese operates up-market retail and department stores in Shanghai.</p>
<p>On August 30, the company announced unaudited net profits for first-half 1996 of 26.566 million yuan, up from 15.759 million in the same 1995 period.</p>
</text>
